{"title":"Career roadmap · Manuscript Curator","role":"Manuscript Curator","summary":"A Manuscript Curator works with historical, literary, religious, scientific, administrative and cultural manuscripts, helping to identify, catalogue, preserve, digitise, interpret and provide access to collections. A BA in Sanskrit is particularly relevant for Sanskrit manuscripts, Indic knowledge traditions, palm-leaf manuscripts, archival collections and classical texts.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A Manuscript Curator works with historical, literary, religious, scientific, administrative and cultural manuscripts, helping to identify, catalogue, preserve, digitise, interpret and provide access to collections. A BA in Sanskrit is particularly relevant for Sanskrit manuscripts, Indic knowledge traditions, palm-leaf manuscripts, archival collections and classical texts."},{"type":"flow","items":["The career combines Sanskrit language","palaeography","manuscriptology","conservation awareness","archival science","digitisation","metadata","digital humanities."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term employability, a Sanskrit graduate should move beyond language proficiency and develop expertise in manuscript cataloguing, scripts, preservation, digitisation and digital humanities."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Manuscript Intern, Archive Assistant, Documentation Assistant"},{"text":"Collection handling and documentation"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Manuscript Cataloguer, Manuscript Assistant, Archive Assistant"},{"text":"Cataloguing and archival work"}],[{"text":"Specialist"},{"text":"Manuscript Curator, Manuscriptologist, Sanskrit Manuscript Specialist"},{"text":"Identification, interpretation and collection management"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Senior Manuscript Curator, Digital Archivist"},{"text":"Collections + digitisation"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Collections Manager, Archive Manager, Digital Humanities Specialist"},{"text":"Strategy, preservation and access"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Manuscript/Archives Programme Manager"},{"text":"Institutional collection programmes"}],[{"text":"Academic"},{"text":"Researcher, Manuscriptology Researcher"},{"text":"Textual and manuscript research"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Head of Manuscripts/Archives, Cultural Heritage Manager"},{"text":"Collection and institutional leadership"}],[{"text":"Independent"},{"text":"Manuscript Consultant, Heritage Documentation Consultant"},{"text":"Research and cultural-heritage projects"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BA Sanskrit","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Sanskrit & Cultural Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Core knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit grammar"},{"text":"Sandhi and samāsa"},{"text":"Classical Sanskrit literature"},{"text":"Vedic literature fundamentals"},{"text":"Indian philosophy"},{"text":"Indian history"},{"text":"Epigraphy fundamentals"},{"text":"Cultural history"},{"text":"Textual interpretation"},{"text":"Introduction to manuscripts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Build language ability"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Read Sanskrit confidently"},{"text":"Translate Sanskrit into English/regional languages"},{"text":"Understand grammatical structures"},{"text":"Identify literary genres"},{"text":"Recognise textual variations"},{"text":"Research unfamiliar vocabulary"},{"text":"Use Sanskrit dictionaries and reference works"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important supporting languages"},{"type":"p","text":"English is particularly important for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Academic communication"},{"text":"International collections"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the collection, additional languages such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hindi"},{"text":"Telugu"},{"text":"Tamil"},{"text":"Kannada"},{"text":"Malayalam"},{"text":"Bengali"},{"text":"Marathi"}]},{"type":"p","text":"can be highly useful."},{"type":"h","text":"Year-1 project"},{"type":"h","text":"Introduction to a Sanskrit Manuscript Collection"},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscript title"},{"text":"Subject"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Approximate period"},{"text":"Material"},{"text":"Physical condition"},{"text":"Number of folios/pages"},{"text":"Collection/source"},{"text":"Preliminary description"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Manuscriptology & Scripts"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the stage where the student should begin specialising in manuscript studies."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscriptology"},{"text":"Codicology"},{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Textual criticism"},{"text":"Manuscript classification"},{"text":"Manuscript description"},{"text":"Provenance"},{"text":"Historical scripts"},{"text":"Archival terminology"},{"text":"Bibliographic research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scripts to explore"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the intended regional specialisation:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Devanagari"},{"text":"Grantha"},{"text":"Telugu script"},{"text":"Kannada script"},{"text":"Malayalam script"},{"text":"Bengali script"},{"text":"Sharada"},{"text":"Nandinagari"},{"text":"Modi"},{"text":"Other historical scripts relevant to the collection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student does not need to master every script. It is better to become highly proficient in Sanskrit plus two or three historically relevant scripts."},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Comparative Script Identification Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Create examples showing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Script","Region","Approximate period","Text characteristics","Identification rationale"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Cataloguing, Preservation & Digitisation"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern manuscript curator needs more than literary knowledge."},{"type":"h","text":"Cataloguing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to record:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection ID"},{"text":"Accession number"},{"text":"Title"},{"text":"Author"},{"text":"Scribe"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Material"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Folio count"},{"text":"Condition"},{"text":"Provenance"},{"text":"Date/period"},{"text":"Subject"},{"text":"Incipit"},{"text":"Explicit"},{"text":"Notes"},{"text":"Related manuscripts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Metadata"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Descriptive metadata"},{"text":"Administrative metadata"},{"text":"Technical metadata"},{"text":"Preservation metadata"},{"text":"Controlled vocabularies"},{"text":"Authority records"},{"text":"Persistent identifiers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digitisation Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the workflow:"},{"type":"h","text":"Physical manuscript"},{"type":"h","text":"Condition assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Digitisation planning"},{"type":"h","text":"High-resolution imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"File naming"},{"type":"h","text":"Metadata creation"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality control"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital preservation"},{"type":"h","text":"Online access"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful skills include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital photography"},{"text":"Image processing"},{"text":"OCR concepts"},{"text":"IIIF concepts"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"XML/TEI fundamentals"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Database basics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Digital asset management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional Manuscript Curation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to manage a collection rather than simply read manuscripts."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection management"},{"text":"Acquisition documentation"},{"text":"Provenance research"},{"text":"Conservation awareness"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Disaster preparedness"},{"text":"Digitisation project planning"},{"text":"Metadata quality"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Copyright/access considerations"},{"text":"Exhibition development"},{"text":"Public engagement"},{"text":"Research communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"A curator is not necessarily a conservator."},{"type":"p","text":"A curator should understand preservation requirements and recognise risks, but specialised physical conservation—especially treatment of fragile palm-leaf or paper manuscripts—should be performed by appropriately trained conservation professionals."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended project"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Catalogue and Preservation Framework for a Sanskrit Manuscript Collection"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection survey"},{"text":"Manuscript identification"},{"text":"Script identification"},{"text":"Metadata schema"},{"text":"Catalogue records"},{"text":"Condition classification"},{"text":"Digitisation workflow"},{"text":"Sample digital images"},{"text":"Searchable database"},{"text":"Preservation recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative projects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit manuscript digitisation"},{"text":"Comparative study of Devanagari and regional scripts"},{"text":"Digital catalogue of Sanskrit palm-leaf manuscripts"},{"text":"OCR challenges in Sanskrit manuscripts"},{"text":"AI-assisted Sanskrit manuscript transcription"},{"text":"Metadata framework for Indic manuscripts"},{"text":"Digital preservation of traditional knowledge"},{"text":"Textual variants across manuscript witnesses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Honours with Research"},{"type":"p","text":"The additional year can be used for deeper research in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Manuscriptology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Codicology"},{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Textual criticism"},{"text":"Manuscript cataloguing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sanskrit Studies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vedic literature"},{"text":"Classical Sanskrit"},{"text":"Nyaya"},{"text":"Mimamsa"},{"text":"Vedanta"},{"text":"Ayurveda texts"},{"text":"Jyotisha texts"},{"text":"Dharmashastra"},{"text":"Kavya"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Humanities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit NLP"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Digital editions"},{"text":"TEI/XML"},{"text":"Manuscript databases"},{"text":"Knowledge graphs"},{"text":"Computational philology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A research-oriented pathway is particularly valuable for students targeting universities, research institutions, museums and major manuscript collections."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Skills","Potential Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Sanskrit Manuscripts"},{"text":"Sanskrit + manuscriptology"},{"text":"Manuscript Specialist"}],[{"text":"Palm-Leaf Manuscripts"},{"text":"Codicology + preservation"},{"text":"Manuscript Curator"}],[{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Historical scripts"},{"text":"Palaeography Researcher"}],[{"text":"Textual Criticism"},{"text":"Text comparison"},{"text":"Textual Researcher"}],[{"text":"Digital Archives"},{"text":"Metadata + databases"},{"text":"Digital Archivist"}],[{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"NLP + digital editions"},{"text":"Digital Humanities Researcher"}],[{"text":"Museum Collections"},{"text":"Curation + interpretation"},{"text":"Museum Collections Specialist"}],[{"text":"Epigraphy"},{"text":"Inscriptions + scripts"},{"text":"Epigraphy Researcher"}],[{"text":"Cultural Heritage"},{"text":"Heritage documentation"},{"text":"Heritage Specialist"}],[{"text":"Manuscript Digitisation"},{"text":"Imaging + metadata"},{"text":"Digitisation Specialist"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Sanskrit but weak manuscript knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Manuscriptology","codicology","palaeography","cataloguing"]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Sanskrit but weak technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Metadata","digital repositories","imaging","OCR","XML/TEI","databases"]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong manuscript knowledge but weak research"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Textual criticism","bibliography","archival research","academic writing"]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong research but weak employability"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digitisation portfolio","catalogue samples","metadata","database skills","internship"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Interested in AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Move toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sanskrit","palaeography","OCR","NLP","digital humanities","manuscript AI evaluation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Seek internships with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscript libraries"},{"text":"Archives"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Sanskrit research institutions"},{"text":"Cultural heritage organisations"},{"text":"Digital humanities laboratories"},{"text":"Libraries"},{"text":"Digitisation projects"},{"text":"Archaeological/heritage institutions"},{"text":"Indological research centres"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful internship responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscript cataloguing"},{"text":"Collection surveys"},{"text":"Metadata entry"},{"text":"Script identification"},{"text":"Digitisation"},{"text":"Image quality control"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Bibliographic research"},{"text":"Digital archive development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest internship is one where the student produces actual catalogue records or digitisation documentation."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Manuscript & archival skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscriptology"},{"text":"Archival studies"},{"text":"Library and Information Science"},{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Codicology"},{"text":"Conservation awareness"},{"text":"Digital preservation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital humanities"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XML"},{"text":"TEI"},{"text":"IIIF"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"GIS where relevant"},{"text":"Digital asset management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sanskrit"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced study in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit grammar"},{"text":"Textual interpretation"},{"text":"Classical literature"},{"text":"Vedic Sanskrit"},{"text":"Manuscript reading"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are supplementary; actual manuscript-reading, cataloguing and digitisation experience carries greater value."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscript Intern"},{"text":"Archive Assistant"},{"text":"Documentation Assistant"},{"text":"Collection Assistant"},{"text":"Library Assistant"},{"text":"Digitisation Assistant"},{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Sanskrit Research Assistant"},{"text":"Manuscript Cataloguing Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With specialisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscript Cataloguer"},{"text":"Manuscript Specialist"},{"text":"Manuscript Curator"},{"text":"Manuscriptologist"},{"text":"Digital Archivist"},{"text":"Digital Collections Specialist"},{"text":"Digitisation Specialist"},{"text":"Sanskrit Researcher"},{"text":"Palaeography Research Assistant"},{"text":"Cultural Heritage Documentation Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Manuscript Curator"},{"text":"Collections Manager"},{"text":"Digital Humanities Specialist"},{"text":"Archive Manager"},{"text":"Manuscript Project Manager"},{"text":"Cultural Heritage Programme Manager"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Specific government, university, museum and research-institution posts can have prescribed qualifications beyond a BA, and titles such as curator, archivist or research officer may require postgraduate qualifications or experience."},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Sanskrit"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Read and translate a Sanskrit passage."},{"text":"Identify grammatical structures."},{"text":"Explain a difficult textual passage."},{"text":"Identify literary genre and context."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Manuscript identification"},{"type":"note","label":"Question","text":"What information should a manuscript catalogue record contain?"},{"type":"p","text":"Expected areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Title"},{"text":"Author"},{"text":"Language"},{"text":"Script"},{"text":"Material"},{"text":"Folio count"},{"text":"Dimensions"},{"text":"Date/period"},{"text":"Scribe where known"},{"text":"Provenance"},{"text":"Condition"},{"text":"Incipit/explicit"},{"text":"Subject"},{"text":"Collection information"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Palaeography"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify the script and explain the characteristics that led to your identification."},{"type":"h","text":"Collection management"},{"type":"p","text":"How would you prioritise manuscripts for digitisation?"},{"type":"p","text":"A good response considers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical condition"},{"text":"Research significance"},{"text":"Rarity"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Cultural importance"},{"text":"Risk of loss"},{"text":"Digitisation feasibility"},{"text":"Preservation requirements"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree can significantly strengthen this career."},{"type":"h","text":"MA Sanskrit"},{"type":"p","text":"Best for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit research"},{"text":"Manuscript studies"},{"text":"Teaching"},{"text":"Textual research"},{"text":"Academia"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MA/PG in Manuscriptology"},{"type":"p","text":"Best for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscript curation"},{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Codicology"},{"text":"Manuscript research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Master of Library & Information Science (MLIS)"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archives"},{"text":"Libraries"},{"text":"Digital collections"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Information management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MA Archaeology / Heritage Studies"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cultural heritage"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Heritage documentation"},{"text":"Conservation ecosystem"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Humanities / Information Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital archives"},{"text":"Digital editions"},{"text":"Manuscript databases"},{"text":"Computational humanities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD"},{"type":"p","text":"For advanced research and academic careers:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit"},{"text":"Manuscriptology"},{"text":"Indology"},{"text":"Epigraphy"},{"text":"Digital humanities"},{"text":"Cultural heritage"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscript Studies"},{"text":"Conservation"},{"text":"Archival Studies"},{"text":"Library & Information Science"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"History"},{"text":"Asian Studies"},{"text":"South Asian Studies"},{"text":"Classical Studies"},{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Cultural Heritage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful international specialisations"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Humanities"},{"type":"p","text":"→ digital editions, databases, computational textual analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Archival Studies"},{"type":"p","text":"→ collection management, preservation, access"},{"type":"h","text":"Conservation"},{"type":"p","text":"→ physical preservation and treatment"},{"type":"h","text":"Museum Studies"},{"type":"p","text":"→ collections, exhibitions and public engagement"},{"type":"h","text":"South Asian Studies"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Sanskrit, Indic manuscripts, history and textual traditions"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Archive/Manuscript Assistant"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Transcription"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digitisation"},{"text":"Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Manuscript Cataloguer / Manuscript Specialist"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Collection knowledge"},{"text":"Manuscript description"},{"text":"Digital workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Manuscript Curator / Digital Archivist"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection management"},{"text":"Digitisation projects"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Exhibition/public access"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8–12 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Curator / Collections Manager"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Team leadership"},{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Institutional partnerships"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Research programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"12+ Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Manuscripts / Cultural Heritage Programme Head / Consultant"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible directions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major manuscript collections"},{"text":"Digital heritage programmes"},{"text":"Museums"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"International cultural-heritage projects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Manuscript curation is likely to become increasingly connected with AI, computer vision, digital humanities and computational philology."},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Read","Catalogue","Preserve","Research"]},{"type":"h","text":"Future workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Digitise","AI-assisted Recognition","Human Verification","Structured Metadata","Digital Edition","Knowledge Graph","Global Access"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Manuscript Curator"},{"text":"AI Manuscript Specialist"},{"text":"Manuscript Digitisation Manager"},{"text":"Sanskrit NLP Specialist"},{"text":"Computational Philology Researcher"},{"text":"Digital Humanities Researcher"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Textual Criticism Specialist"},{"text":"Cultural Heritage Data Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Collections Manager"},{"text":"Heritage Knowledge Graph Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI applications"},{"type":"p","text":"AI may assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Script recognition"},{"text":"Handwriting recognition"},{"text":"OCR/HTR"},{"text":"Sanskrit text extraction"},{"text":"Manuscript transcription"},{"text":"Text alignment"},{"text":"Variant detection"},{"text":"Metadata generation"},{"text":"Image enhancement"},{"text":"Search"},{"text":"Translation assistance"},{"text":"Knowledge-graph creation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, human scholarly verification remains essential, particularly where historical scripts, damaged text, ambiguous readings and textual variants are involved."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Sanskrit & Humanities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Sanskrit"},{"text":"Sanskrit grammar"},{"text":"Classical literature"},{"text":"Indian intellectual traditions"},{"text":"Cultural history"},{"text":"Research methodology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Manuscript Studies"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manuscriptology"},{"text":"Codicology"},{"text":"Palaeography"},{"text":"Textual criticism"},{"text":"Manuscript description"},{"text":"Provenance research"},{"text":"Cataloguing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Archival Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collection management"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Digital preservation"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Digitisation"},{"text":"Digital asset management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"High-resolution imaging"},{"text":"OCR/HTR concepts"},{"text":"IIIF"},{"text":"XML/TEI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Digital repositories"},{"text":"Database management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Digital Humanities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit NLP"},{"text":"OCR evaluation"},{"text":"AI-assisted transcription"},{"text":"Text alignment"},{"text":"Computational philology"},{"text":"Knowledge graphs"},{"text":"AI quality evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research writing"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Academic communication"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Exhibition interpretation"},{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"Cultural-heritage ethics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Sanskrit","Manuscriptology + Palaeography","Cataloguing + Digitisation","Manuscript/Archive Internship","Archive Assistant / Manuscript Cataloguing Assistant","Manuscript Specialist / Digital Collections Specialist","Manuscript Curator / Digital Archivist","Senior Curator / Collections Manager","Head of Manuscripts / Cultural Heritage Programme Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For a BA Sanskrit student targeting Manuscript Curator, the strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sanskrit proficiency","manuscriptology","palaeography","codicology","cataloguing","digitisation","metadata","digital humanities","AI-assisted manuscript analysis."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The BA provides the language and cultural foundation, but postgraduate manuscriptology/library-archival training and hands-on collection experience will substantially strengthen eligibility for specialist curator and research positions."}]}]}